                                "sense_id": "299cdb84-6499-3f0f-a465-1cea9878b768",
                                "text": "la dernière pelletée d'escarbilles était brûlée depuis la veille"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ecb37f83-f238-3f11-86ad-7beb46fd3eb1",
                        "entry_id": "7aa419c5-6842-35fd-ae9a-6d3f7402011e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a speck of ember that escapes from a fire and floats in the air; floating ember"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc5c0fc4-fe33-482f-b9b6-84cde3fdda56",
                                "sense_id": "ecb37f83-f238-3f11-86ad-7beb46fd3eb1",
                                "text": "J'aimais les trains. Penchée à la portière, j'offrais mon visage au vent et aux escarbilles[…]",
                                "translation": "I love trains. Leaning out the door I offer my face to the wind and the embers […]",
                                "english": "I love trains. Leaning out the door I offer my face to the wind and the embers […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
